.TH SAVE_LOAD 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
save_load \- Read a slot into out
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsave.h\(dq
.BI "bool save_load(const Save *s, const char *slot, void *out, size_t size, uint32_t version);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read a slot into out. Fails (without touching out) if the file is missing, the version differs, or the size does not match.
.SH RETURN VALUE
true on success.
.SH MODULE
save (src/engine/save/save.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR save_write (3),
.BR gge (1),
.BR gge\-scenes (7)
